he $x$-axis is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{x} & ={∬}_{D}{y}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{x}^{3}}^{{x}^{2}}{y}^{2}\\cdot 20Mx\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =20M{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{x}^{3}}^{{x}^{2}}x{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =20M{\\int }_{0}^{1}{[\\frac{1}{3}x{y}^{3}]}_{y={x}^{3}}^{y={x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{20M}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{7}-{x}^{10}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{20M}{3}{[\\frac{1}{8}{x}^{8}-\\frac{1}{11}{x}^{11}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{20M}{3}(\\frac{1}{8}-\\frac{1}{11}) \\\\  & =\\frac{20M}{3}\\cdot \\frac{3}{88} \\\\  & =\\frac{5M}{22}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the radius of gyration about the $x$-axis is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{R}_{x} & =\\sqrt{\\frac{{I}_{x}}{M}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{5M}{22}\\cdot \\frac{1}{M}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{5}{22}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536027 true] [17592186379945 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379946 13194139536027 true] [17592186379945 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379947 13194139536027 true] [17592186379945 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379948 13194139536027 true] [17592186379945 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379949 13194139536027 true] [17592186379945 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379950 13194139536027 true] [17592186379945 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536027 true] [17592186379945 1041 "selection" 13194139536027 true] [17592186379945 1104 #edb/ref 17592186379948 13194139536027 true] [17592186379945 1110 #uuid "da0954a8-5ca4-5af1-ba8e-132189df6306" 13194139536027 true] [17592186379946 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{4}" 13194139536027 true] [17592186379946 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536027 true] [17592186379946 1111 #uuid "c99e2c5c-421a-55ee-ada2-296ef7391ad4" 13194139536027 true] [17592186379947 1034 "\\frac{2}{3}" 13194139536027 true] [17592186379947 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536027 true] [17592186379947 1111 #uuid "60f521be-731f-5cf8-a200-ca375ca4d946" 13194139536027 true] [17592186379948 1034 "\\sqrt{\\frac{5}{22}}" 13194139536027 true] [175